\frac{T_{\text {sat }}}{T_{\text {moon }}}=\sqrt{\frac{1}{729}}=\frac{1}{27} \Longrightarrow T_{\text {sat }}=\frac{T_{\text {moon }}}{27}=\frac{27 \text { days }}{27}=1 \text { day }
