2. Find acceleration: The net force causes the total mass to accelerate.
$$
a=\frac{F_{\text {net }}}{m_{\text {total }}}=\frac{m_2 g / 2}{m_1+m_2}=\frac{m_2 g}{2\left(m_1+m_2\right)}
